[{"answer":"Hello, Linda speaking.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh hi, Linda.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/2.mp3"},{"answer":"This is Matt Brooks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Alex White gave me your number.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/4.mp3"},{"answer":"He said you'd be able to give me some advice about moving to Banford.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, Alex did mention you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/6.mp3"},{"answer":"How can I help?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, first of all - which area to live in?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/8.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I live in Dalton, which is a really nice suburb -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/9.mp3"},{"answer":"not too expensive, and there's a nice park.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/10.mp3"},{"answer":"Sounds good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/11.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you know how much it would be to rent a two bedroom flat there?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/12.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, you should be able to get something reasonable for 850 pounds per month.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/13.mp3"},{"answer":"That's what people typically pay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/14.mp3"},{"answer":"You certainly wouldn't want to pay more than 900 pounds.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/15.mp3"},{"answer":"That doesn't include bills or anything.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/16.mp3"},{"answer":"No. That sounds alright.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/17.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll definitely have a look there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/18.mp3"},{"answer":"Are the transport links easy from where you live?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/19.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, I'm very lucky.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/20.mp3"},{"answer":"I work in the city centre so I don't have to use public transport.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/21.mp3"},{"answer":"I go by bike.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, I wish I could do that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/23.mp3"},{"answer":"Is it safe to cycle around the city?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/24.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, it's fine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/25.mp3"},{"answer":"And it keeps me fit.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/26.mp3"},{"answer":"Anyway, driving to work in the city centre would be a nightmare","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/27.mp3"},{"answer":"because there's hardly any parking.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/28.mp3"},{"answer":"And the traffic during the rush hour can be bad.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/29.mp3"},{"answer":"I'd be working from home","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/30.mp3"},{"answer":"but I'd have to go to London one or two days a week.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/31.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, that's perfect.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/32.mp3"},{"answer":"Getting to London is no problem.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/33.mp3"},{"answer":"There's a fast train every 30 minutes which only takes 45 minutes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/34.mp3"},{"answer":"That's good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/35.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, the train service isn't bad during the week.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/36.mp3"},{"answer":"And they run quite late at night.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/37.mp3"},{"answer":"It's weekends that are a problem.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/38.mp3"},{"answer":"They're always doing engineering work","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/39.mp3"},{"answer":"and you have to take a bus to Hadham","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/40.mp3"},{"answer":"and pick up the train there, which is really slow.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/41.mp3"},{"answer":"But other than that, Banford's a great place to live.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/42.mp3"},{"answer":"I've never been happier.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/43.mp3"},{"answer":"There are some nice restaurants in the city centre","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/44.mp3"},{"answer":"and a brand new cinema which has only been open a couple of months.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/45.mp3"},{"answer":"There's a good arts centre too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/46.mp3"},{"answer":"Sounds like Banford's got it all.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/47.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes! We're really lucky.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/48.mp3"},{"answer":"There are lots of really good aspects to living here.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/49.mp3"},{"answer":"The schools are good","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/50.mp3"},{"answer":"and the hospital here is one of the best in the country.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/51.mp3"},{"answer":"Everyone I know who's been there's had a positive experience.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/52.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, I can give you the name of my dentist too in Bridge Street,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/53.mp3"},{"answer":"if you're interested.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/54.mp3"},{"answer":"I've been going to him for years and I've never had any problems.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/55.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, OK. Thanks!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/56.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll find his number and send it to you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/57.mp3"},{"answer":"Thanks, that would be really helpful.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/58.mp3"},{"answer":"Are you planning to visit Banford soon?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/59.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/60.mp3"},{"answer":"My wife and I are both coming next week.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/61.mp3"},{"answer":"We want to make some appointments with estate agents.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/62.mp3"},{"answer":"I could meet you if you like and show you around.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/63.mp3"},{"answer":"Are you sure?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/64.mp3"},{"answer":"We'd really appreciate that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/65.mp3"},{"answer":"Either a Tuesday or Thursday is good for me, after 5.30.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/66.mp3"},{"answer":"Thursday's preferable.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/67.mp3"},{"answer":"Tuesday I need to get home before 6 pm.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/68.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay great.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/69.mp3"},{"answer":"Let me know which train you're catching","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/70.mp3"},{"answer":"and I'll meet you in the cafe outside.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/71.mp3"},{"answer":"You can't miss it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/72.mp3"},{"answer":"It's opposite the station and next to the museum.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/73.mp3"},{"answer":"Brilliant.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/74.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll text you next week then.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/75.mp3"},{"answer":"Thanks so much for all the advice.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/76.mp3"},{"answer":"No problem.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/77.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll see you next week.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-3-part-1-2023-03-20-11-13-45/78.mp3"}]
